{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":33,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":33,"text":"  holding half-up for every share is the part done right","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":34,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":34,"text":"  here, and it is why no single percent is misrounded","end":"\n"}
