{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":75,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":75,"text":"Each share is rounded half-up, same rule, within half a point - none is wrong.","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":76,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":76,"text":"Two sit at exactly 33.5 and round up, so the parts sum to 101 where the whole","end":"\n"}
